The '''Skeleton Keychain''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable. It is unlocked from the [[Raffle of the Century]] during Year 500.

== Obtaining ==
'''Skeleton Keychains''' are a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from the Year 500 [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Skeleton Keychain''' rewards the player with {{Item|Skeleton Key|amount=16}}. The following message also displays:
{{Dialogue|&d&lWOW! &eYou unhooked the keychain and got &a16x &6Skeleton Key&f!}}

Additionally, a rustling sound plays upon opening.

== Trivia ==
* Despite the item being [[Soulbound]], the {{Item|Skeleton Key|amount=16}} can be sold to [[Bazaar]] for {{BZC|16 Skeleton Key}}.
